        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/431c484ce949ebb0496fd5a1f7d8792b.avif?t=1781699172\" width=1560 height=216 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who This Game Is / Isn’t For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Important: This is an Early Access (MVP) minimal build]<br>・No need to rush your purchase. If it’s not for you, refunds are OK.<br>・This is a deck-building roguelite built around the tactile feel that “every turn’s choice matters.”<br>・A story- or cutscene-heavy experience is not included in this title (that direction is being considered for a separate project).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The demo allows you to play through the first layer. The content is identical to the full version; only the automatic ending after clearing Layer 1 is exclusive to the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・If you are satisfied after playing the demo, we recommend purchasing the full (Early Access) version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Who it’s for]<br>・Players who enjoy building their own win conditions through deck construction<br>・Players who want to feel each turn’s decision meaningfully affect the outcome<br>・Players who like 20–40 minute roguelite runs they can replay<br>・Players who enjoy touching a game in its early stage and watching it grow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Who it isn’t for (we recommend waiting for the full release)]<br>・Players who prefer to relax and enjoy the game only after it’s fully complete<br>・Players seeking a long, story- or presentation-driven experience<br>・Players expecting a large roster of characters/cards from day one</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Current scope (will be kept up to date with real measurements)]<br>・One run: 20–40 minutes<br>・Playable characters: 1<br>・Cards: 75</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development &amp; Update Policy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release Approach:</strong> Ship each feature as it’s ready (small, frequent releases).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Issues:</strong> Progress-blocking bugs will be addressed promptly via hotfixes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Community &amp; reporting]<br>・All feedback is centralized in the Steam Community discussions.<br>・We’ll share status via News posts and update announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Pricing &amp; before you buy]<br>・Early Access uses a modest price; we plan to increase the price for the full release (in line with added content).<br>・Please check “Who it’s for / isn’t for” before purchasing. If it’s not your thing, please refund—your time matters most when the game truly fits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/368c4f8867a2035cc18aef393832b4eb.avif?t=1781699172\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NINDO Guardian of the Starlit Shadow </strong>is a ninja-themed roguelike deckbuilding game set in a beautifully stylized Japanese world. <br>Face powerful enemies, grow through choices, and craft your own unique path of strategy and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/44c145b3e986c3fc2f7219c162f9df11.poster.avif?t=1781699172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/44c145b3e986c3fc2f7219c162f9df11.webm?t=1781699172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/44c145b3e986c3fc2f7219c162f9df11.mp4?t=1781699172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ <strong>Striking Visuals: Anime Meets Traditional Japan</strong><br>Explore a vivid world where classic Japanese aesthetics blend with colorful anime-style visuals. Unique characters and enemies bring this world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 <strong>Deckbuilding with Tactical Depth</strong><br>Choose new cards after each battle to strengthen your deck. Use ninjutsu, martial arts, and ultimate techniques to outsmart your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong><br>Each dungeon run offers new encounters and events. Learn from defeat, grow stronger, and dive back into the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Storytelling through Flavor Text</strong><br>Discover the pasts and fates of the ninja through the rich flavor text on cards and items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Flow</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse procedurally generated maps filled with battles and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards strategically to defeat your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your deck with new cards, items, and gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own <strong>NINDO</strong> — the way of the ninja.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.poster.avif?t=1781699172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.webm?t=1781699172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458600/extras/739717bd95802dd5382514ab2216683c.mp4?t=1781699172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
